(6845423, 1030194, 101256, '<td valign="top">Sometimes we try to hard to get exactly the right light and the right focus and the right position.  This is a good example - the right side of the face (her right, our left)is very grainy and detracts from what is actually a very good portrait.</td>', 'Sometimes we try to hard to get exactly the right light and the right focus and the right position.  This is a good example - the right side of the face (her right, our left)is very grainy and detracts from what is actually a very good portrait.', '2012-08-20 19:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
