(6845673, 1030336, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like this but there isn''t a lot of definition between the skin tones and the wall color.  There is also a very slight green tint around the window which is probably the result of the green window pane. Overall a good effort - just needed a little more "thoguht" to pull off.</td>', 'I like this but there isn''t a lot of definition between the skin tones and the wall color.  There is also a very slight green tint around the window which is probably the result of the green window pane. Overall a good effort - just needed a little more "thoguht" to pull off.', '2012-08-21 09:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845674, 1030365, 101256, '<td valign="top">I readjusted the color temp on my monitor because I thought something had gone wrong with the video card. I like it - a very natural pose, interesting subject but the lack of real contrast between the dress and the face washes it out. What I''m trying to say (badly) is that the dress and skin are very similar in terms of color scale and everything just blends together. It would have made a really good image if the dress had been black or a dark blue.</td>', 'I readjusted the color temp on my monitor because I thought something had gone wrong with the video card. I like it - a very natural pose, interesting subject but the lack of real contrast between the dress and the face washes it out. What I''m trying to say (badly) is that the dress and skin are very similar in terms of color scale and everything just blends together. It would have made a really good image if the dress had been black or a dark blue.', '2012-08-21 09:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845675, 1030309, 101256, '<td valign="top">Love the pose but the overwhelming neutral colors don''t do the boy''s complexion any favors - there appears to be an unnatural amount of grain which is probably due to a slight over tweaking of the image.</td>', 'Love the pose but the overwhelming neutral colors don''t do the boy''s complexion any favors - there appears to be an unnatural amount of grain which is probably due to a slight over tweaking of the image.', '2012-08-21 09:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845677, 1030396, 101256, '<td valign="top">This looks a lot, and I do mean a lot, like a early 40''s black and white movie poster.  Just perfect - lighting, conversion, everything is just perfect.  A worthy contender for a Top Five finish.</td>', 'This looks a lot, and I do mean a lot, like a early 40''s black and white movie poster.  Just perfect - lighting, conversion, everything is just perfect.  A worthy contender for a Top Five finish.', '2012-08-21 09:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845678, 1030277, 101256, '<td valign="top">".....The sitter is merely the accident, the occasion. It is not he who is<br/>revealed by the painter, it is rather the painter who, on the colored<br/>canvas, reveals himself".  Well, I think we got the general idea here - apparently the artist believes that the self is disorganized and out of focus. Ok, I''ll buy into that. Well done.</td>', '".....The sitter is merely the accident, the occasion. It is not he who isrevealed by the painter, it is rather the painter who, on the coloredcanvas, reveals himself".  Well, I think we got the general idea here - apparently the artist believes that the self is disorganized and out of focus. Ok, I''ll buy into that. Well done.', '2012-08-21 09:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845679, 1030207, 101256, '<td valign="top">Accidental maybe, but the reflection in the glasses as he peers through the blinds just makes this a brilliant portrait - almost candid in it''s execution. Very nicely done and a Top Five for sure.</td>', 'Accidental maybe, but the reflection in the glasses as he peers through the blinds just makes this a brilliant portrait - almost candid in it''s execution. Very nicely done and a Top Five for sure.', '2012-08-21 09:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845680, 1030274, 101256, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great image it just doesn''t have a lot of "pop" if you will - something is missing to make it truly memorable.  Still a good image - nicely captured.</td>', 'I think this is a great image it just doesn''t have a lot of "pop" if you will - something is missing to make it truly memorable.  Still a good image - nicely captured.', '2012-08-21 09:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845681, 1030311, 101256, '<td valign="top">I love conceptual art that makes you do a double take just because it is so different.  I like this a lot, then I''m more into abstracts and portraits than most. Nice. If I were in control of the voting, this would be a winner. As it is, it probably won''t garner a lot of high marks.</td>', 'I love conceptual art that makes you do a double take just because it is so different.  I like this a lot, then I''m more into abstracts and portraits than most. Nice. If I were in control of the voting, this would be a winner. As it is, it probably won''t garner a lot of high marks.', '2012-08-21 09:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845682, 1030331, 101256, '<td valign="top">There is something about babies that just demonstrate pure emotion. Obviously baby is amused and that''s a good thing.</td>', 'There is something about babies that just demonstrate pure emotion. Obviously baby is amused and that''s a good thing.', '2012-08-21 09:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845684, 1030129, 101256, '<td valign="top">Nice control of the gray scale, great focus, terrific shading - it''s a really great image.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice control of the gray scale, great focus, terrific shading - it''s a really great image.  Well done.', '2012-08-21 09:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845685, 1030398, 101256, '<td valign="top">Um....okay - I get it - I think.  Well, on second thought, no, no I don''t.</td>', 'Um....okay - I get it - I think.  Well, on second thought, no, no I don''t.', '2012-08-21 09:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845686, 1030280, 101256, '<td valign="top">Sometimes what seems like a good idea isn''t.  This is one that isn''t. It''s ugly. Maybe that was the intent, but this is truly ugly ugly - not plain ugly.</td>', 'Sometimes what seems like a good idea isn''t.  This is one that isn''t. It''s ugly. Maybe that was the intent, but this is truly ugly ugly - not plain ugly.', '2012-08-21 09:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845687, 1030247, 73942, '<td valign="top">adorable future photogs</td>', 'adorable future photogs', '2012-08-21 09:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845688, 1030017, 73942, '<td valign="top">precious moment</td>', 'precious moment', '2012-08-21 09:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845689, 1030405, 73942, '<td valign="top">beautiful child, beautiful portrait</td>', 'beautiful child, beautiful portrait', '2012-08-21 09:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845690, 1029869, 73942, '<td valign="top">wonderful portrait</td>', 'wonderful portrait', '2012-08-21 09:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845691, 1030363, 73942, '<td valign="top">such a sweet smile</td>', 'such a sweet smile', '2012-08-21 09:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845692, 1030238, 101256, '<td valign="top">I had to come back to this three times because I initially wanted to vote this a 10, but was annoyed by something - couldn''t figure it out. The light to dark transition (our left to right) goes from washout to fine detail in too abrupt a fashion. Don''t misunderstand me - this is a great image, just the technical details messed it up.  A little more work with a light meter and changing the angle of the face would have helped a lot.</td>', 'I had to come back to this three times because I initially wanted to vote this a 10, but was annoyed by something - couldn''t figure it out. The light to dark transition (our left to right) goes from washout to fine detail in too abrupt a fashion. Don''t misunderstand me - this is a great image, just the technical details messed it up.  A little more work with a light meter and changing the angle of the face would have helped a lot.', '2012-08-21 09:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845693, 1030407, 101256, '<td valign="top">Great DOF control, terrific lighting, a very nice conversion. Sadly the subject just isn''t that interesting - boring in fact. Too bad, this had potential.</td>', 'Great DOF control, terrific lighting, a very nice conversion. Sadly the subject just isn''t that interesting - boring in fact. Too bad, this had potential.', '2012-08-21 09:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845695, 1030291, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is a face with character - it shows a great amount of personality - everything from mischief to wisdom. Somehow it got screwed by the dark condition which hides the face almost in half - from no detail to too much detail. This could have been a Top Five image if a little more thought had gone into it. Really unfortunate that it came out this way.</td>', 'This is a face with character - it shows a great amount of personality - everything from mischief to wisdom. Somehow it got screwed by the dark condition which hides the face almost in half - from no detail to too much detail. This could have been a Top Five image if a little more thought had gone into it. Really unfortunate that it came out this way.', '2012-08-21 09:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845696, 1030191, 101256, '<td valign="top">Technically a terrific image - it just isn''t interesting.  There''s nothing there to make you want to keep looking at it.</td>', 'Technically a terrific image - it just isn''t interesting.  There''s nothing there to make you want to keep looking at it.', '2012-08-21 09:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845700, 1030297, 101256, '<td valign="top">Great conversion control, the image just isn''t very interesting - really has nothing to latch onto - just a snapshot really.</td>', 'Great conversion control, the image just isn''t very interesting - really has nothing to latch onto - just a snapshot really.', '2012-08-21 09:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845701, 1030241, 101256, '<td valign="top">What is it about photographers who want to photograph white against white. This is a very dramatic pose with a photogenic model and it''s all washed out in a blast of white. Ugh.</td>', 'What is it about photographers who want to photograph white against white. This is a very dramatic pose with a photogenic model and it''s all washed out in a blast of white. Ugh.', '2012-08-21 09:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845703, 1030335, 101256, '<td valign="top">Yep - it sure is a great image of a poured concrete wall.</td>', 'Yep - it sure is a great image of a poured concrete wall.', '2012-08-21 09:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845712, 1030369, 101256, '<td valign="top">After some indecision, I''ve decided that I really like this. Not perfect from a technical standpoint, but I think that is part of it''s overall charm. Nice capture. Well done.</td>', 'After some indecision, I''ve decided that I really like this. Not perfect from a technical standpoint, but I think that is part of it''s overall charm. Nice capture. Well done.', '2012-08-21 09:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845717, 1030174, 101256, '<td valign="top">Can''t decide if this is over exposed, over processed or exactly what, but this is not a great image.l</td>', 'Can''t decide if this is over exposed, over processed or exactly what, but this is not a great image.l', '2012-08-21 09:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845718, 1030378, 101256, '<td valign="top">An interesting portrait - half shadow portrait half image. I like it, but think it needs a little more detail of the head - maybe a little distance would have helped it''s overall impact.</td>', 'An interesting portrait - half shadow portrait half image. I like it, but think it needs a little more detail of the head - maybe a little distance would have helped it''s overall impact.', '2012-08-21 09:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845719, 1030167, 101256, '<td valign="top">Call it a "thing" that I have, but I hate it when the tops of heads are clipped off in candid or posed portraits - kind of ruins the overall effect.</td>', 'Call it a "thing" that I have, but I hate it when the tops of heads are clipped off in candid or posed portraits - kind of ruins the overall effect.', '2012-08-21 09:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845720, 1030281, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is a great example of how to do a natural light photo in black and white. Nicely done - terrific execution of technique. This is a technical tour de force.</td>', 'This is a great example of how to do a natural light photo in black and white. Nicely done - terrific execution of technique. This is a technical tour de force.', '2012-08-21 09:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845721, 1030402, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is what I was talking about earlier about contrasting shades making or breaking an image.  This is a perfect example of contrasting color giving the image some character. Nicely done - a top ten for sure.</td>', 'This is what I was talking about earlier about contrasting shades making or breaking an image.  This is a perfect example of contrasting color giving the image some character. Nicely done - a top ten for sure.', '2012-08-21 09:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845722, 1030050, 101256, '<td valign="top">Again with the top of the head lopped off. Technically, this is a terrific image, artistically it is awful. Sorry, my opinion.</td>', 'Again with the top of the head lopped off. Technically, this is a terrific image, artistically it is awful. Sorry, my opinion.', '2012-08-21 09:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845724, 1030179, 23484, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Nice overall composition.</td>', 'I really like this. Nice overall composition.', '2012-08-21 10:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
