(6845852, 1030178, 101256, '<td valign="top">Great definition, terrific conversion, shading and tones just perfect but we''re back to cutting off the top of the head again. Big distraction for me.</td>', 'Great definition, terrific conversion, shading and tones just perfect but we''re back to cutting off the top of the head again. Big distraction for me.', '2012-08-21 14:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845853, 1030394, 101256, '<td valign="top">I know what the experiment was and I can tell you from experience, it is hard to do as well and perfectly as this one is.  Beautiful and by rights, a Top Five finisher for sure.</td>', 'I know what the experiment was and I can tell you from experience, it is hard to do as well and perfectly as this one is.  Beautiful and by rights, a Top Five finisher for sure.', '2012-08-21 14:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845854, 1029653, 101256, '<td valign="top">Yes ago, there was a Olympus photographer who used to use veils, window sheers and such to make images that were haunting and very ethereal. This exemplifies that technique perfectly. Well done.</td>', 'Yes ago, there was a Olympus photographer who used to use veils, window sheers and such to make images that were haunting and very ethereal. This exemplifies that technique perfectly. Well done.', '2012-08-21 14:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845856, 1030169, 101256, '<td valign="top">A snapshot and not necessarily a "portrait" in the traditional sense. Good conversion, good control over the shading and highlights, it is just not interesting.</td>', 'A snapshot and not necessarily a "portrait" in the traditional sense. Good conversion, good control over the shading and highlights, it is just not interesting.', '2012-08-21 14:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845861, 1030298, 101256, '<td valign="top">Again with the extra side space and chopped head. Meh - nothing there for me to hang any sort of high rating on.</td>', 'Again with the extra side space and chopped head. Meh - nothing there for me to hang any sort of high rating on.', '2012-08-21 14:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845863, 1030116, 101256, '<td valign="top">Chopped head, split face, tons of extra white space - nope, doesn''t work for me. Dreadfully uninteresting and pedestrian.</td>', 'Chopped head, split face, tons of extra white space - nope, doesn''t work for me. Dreadfully uninteresting and pedestrian.', '2012-08-21 14:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845864, 1030146, 101256, '<td valign="top">Much too light - a little darker with the contrast and this would be a perfect image - very natural pose, very natural image.</td>', 'Much too light - a little darker with the contrast and this would be a perfect image - very natural pose, very natural image.', '2012-08-21 14:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845865, 1030399, 101256, '<td valign="top">Heavy dark shadows with the opaque half face technique is hard to pull off successfully. This doesn''t quite do it.</td>', 'Heavy dark shadows with the opaque half face technique is hard to pull off successfully. This doesn''t quite do it.', '2012-08-21 15:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845867, 1030355, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like this - lots of character, lots of intelligence and a little bit of whimsy in the expression.  Again with the chopped off top of the head - I really have a thing about that. In any case, good color control and the overall impact is high as the image is very interesting.</td>', 'I like this - lots of character, lots of intelligence and a little bit of whimsy in the expression.  Again with the chopped off top of the head - I really have a thing about that. In any case, good color control and the overall impact is high as the image is very interesting.', '2012-08-21 15:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845868, 1030286, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is where you don''t use a full frame technique - great image, terrific color control, exquisite detail - wonderful technique. Well done - should be a top five finisher.</td>', 'This is where you don''t use a full frame technique - great image, terrific color control, exquisite detail - wonderful technique. Well done - should be a top five finisher.', '2012-08-21 15:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845869, 1030380, 101256, '<td valign="top">It''s a great snapshot, but that''s it.</td>', 'It''s a great snapshot, but that''s it.', '2012-08-21 15:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845870, 1029869, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''m 50/50 on this - the image is great, the lighting is excellent, DOF control is outstanding - there is just something missing from the impact of the image - no real...I can''t explain it. I''ll give it an 8 anyway.</td>', 'I''m 50/50 on this - the image is great, the lighting is excellent, DOF control is outstanding - there is just something missing from the impact of the image - no real...I can''t explain it. I''ll give it an 8 anyway.', '2012-08-21 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845871, 1030403, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the photographer was going for here, but I don''t think it worked what ever it was. In a portrait something should be obvious or at least give an impression to hang your hat on - there''s just nothing here.</td>', 'I''m not sure what the photographer was going for here, but I don''t think it worked what ever it was. In a portrait something should be obvious or at least give an impression to hang your hat on - there''s just nothing here.', '2012-08-21 15:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845876, 1030179, 101256, '<td valign="top">This image has a lot of impact as there is obviously something going on here that is both poignant and powerful. I can''t explain the emotive aspect this has - it is clearly one hell of an image even with the lame title. I hope others recognize this for what it is and what it portrays.  I can''t say enough good things about it. Wow.</td>', 'This image has a lot of impact as there is obviously something going on here that is both poignant and powerful. I can''t explain the emotive aspect this has - it is clearly one hell of an image even with the lame title. I hope others recognize this for what it is and what it portrays.  I can''t say enough good things about it. Wow.', '2012-08-21 15:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845877, 1030303, 101256, '<td valign="top">Too much orange, too much blank space, too close...ugh.</td>', 'Too much orange, too much blank space, too close...ugh.', '2012-08-21 15:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845880, 1030243, 101256, '<td valign="top">A solid average technique portrait - everything is done correctly and the image is a good one - solid portrait with natural lighting. Well done.</td>', 'A solid average technique portrait - everything is done correctly and the image is a good one - solid portrait with natural lighting. Well done.', '2012-08-21 15:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845881, 1030247, 101256, '<td valign="top">Gets a ten just because the kids are cute.  Minus one for using Canon cameras. :&gt;) I like this a lot - just because - can''t explain it.</td>', 'Gets a ten just because the kids are cute.  Minus one for using Canon cameras. :>) I like this a lot - just because - can''t explain it.', '2012-08-21 15:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845882, 1030333, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is one of those rare cases where the similar color tones actually work to the image''s favor. It''s all about the eyes.  A terrific image - love it.</td>', 'This is one of those rare cases where the similar color tones actually work to the image''s favor. It''s all about the eyes.  A terrific image - love it.', '2012-08-21 15:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845883, 1030276, 101256, '<td valign="top">Average image - nothing special about it. The shading on the subject''s face is different.</td>', 'Average image - nothing special about it. The shading on the subject''s face is different.', '2012-08-21 15:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845884, 1030272, 101256, '<td valign="top">What is it about this half face thing?  It has no artistic application, doesn''t do the subject any favors - it ruined what would have been a great image with a great face to portray.</td>', 'What is it about this half face thing?  It has no artistic application, doesn''t do the subject any favors - it ruined what would have been a great image with a great face to portray.', '2012-08-21 15:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845885, 1030306, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a technique standpoint, it''s terrific. From an artistic standpoint it is terrific.  From an impression standpoint - I don''t like it. I know, strange, but that''s the truth of the matter. But you gotta dance with the one that brung ''ya so if the technique and artistic framework are well done, it''s gotta have a high mark right?</td>', 'From a technique standpoint, it''s terrific. From an artistic standpoint it is terrific.  From an impression standpoint - I don''t like it. I know, strange, but that''s the truth of the matter. But you gotta dance with the one that brung ''ya so if the technique and artistic framework are well done, it''s gotta have a high mark right?', '2012-08-21 15:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6845886, 1030405, 101256, '<td valign="top">Four times I came back to this image as I couldn''t figure out what was wrong with it. Now I know - the full face is slightly out of focus on one side (our right - her left) - leaves the image unbalanced which is a negative.</td>', 'Four times I came back to this image as I couldn''t figure out what was wrong with it. Now I know - the full face is slightly out of focus on one side (our right - her left) - leaves the image unbalanced which is a negative.', '2012-08-21 15:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
