(6849793, 1030377, 94134, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SandyP:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m really surprised to not see this on the front page.  I think it''s one of the best in the challenge. Really really really great job! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you so much! I''m suprised to hear this when I just barely finished under a 6. I thought this would at least bring in a 6.5+. Maybe it was too contrasty or had an uncomfortable vibe? Im not sure, I''d love to know but I know not every photo is a hit. I still have a long way to go in portrait photography. Maybe my new 5d mark 2 will help! Getting it this Friday! Thanks again!</td>', 'Originally posted by SandyP: I''m really surprised to not see this on the front page.  I think it''s one of the best in the challenge. Really really really great job!   Thank you so much! I''m suprised to hear this when I just barely finished under a 6. I thought this would at least bring in a 6.5+. Maybe it was too contrasty or had an uncomfortable vibe? Im not sure, I''d love to know but I know not every photo is a hit. I still have a long way to go in portrait photography. Maybe my new 5d mark 2 will help! Getting it this Friday! Thanks again!', '2012-08-27 03:30:59.000000', NULL, 0),
