(6850505, 1030207, 65319, '<td valign="top">Ha!  My mother''s favorite hobby!  I''m sure if I showed her this image...she''ll want to borrow those ultra cool shades!  I''ll reluctantly congratulate you on 4th place.  Because, in all honesty, I always feel the green ribbon is the worst to get!</td>', 'Ha!  My mother''s favorite hobby!  I''m sure if I showed her this image...she''ll want to borrow those ultra cool shades!  I''ll reluctantly congratulate you on 4th place.  Because, in all honesty, I always feel the green ribbon is the worst to get!', '2012-08-28 03:12:31.000000', NULL, 0),
