(6850546, 1030241, 3084, '<td valign="top">Well done.  I am still trying to figure out why I like this image.<br/> <br/>- Is it the slimness of the model?<br/>- The power of the backlight? <br/>- The richness of the red hair against the offset and mismatch of the toenail colour?<br/>- The awkwardness of the pose?<br/>- The balance of the subject within the frame?<br/>- The rule of thirds framing?<br/>- The fill lighting on the face?  <br/> <br/>I can not identify any one characteristic that makes it work for me.  It is sexy, but not overtly.  Maybe it is a combination of all of these attributes?  Regardless, I like it and it exudes a power and strength.  A well deserved success.</td>', 'Well done.  I am still trying to figure out why I like this image. - Is it the slimness of the model?- The power of the backlight? - The richness of the red hair against the offset and mismatch of the toenail colour?- The awkwardness of the pose?- The balance of the subject within the frame?- The rule of thirds framing?- The fill lighting on the face?   I can not identify any one characteristic that makes it work for me.  It is sexy, but not overtly.  Maybe it is a combination of all of these attributes?  Regardless, I like it and it exudes a power and strength.  A well deserved success.', '2012-08-28 07:20:30.000000', NULL, 0),
